#: ../../source/index.md:8 21d876a8caf945aa83f97c21113e0c0e
msgid ""
"知识追踪，即 Knowledge Tracing，根据学生的历史作答序列估计其知识状态，并预测下一道题能否答对。UniKT "
"在统一的数据管线、学生级交叉验证划分与指标口径下训练和评测知识追踪模型，使不同模型的结果可以公平对比、完整复现。"
msgstr ""
"Knowledge tracing (KT) estimates students' knowledge states from their "
"historical response sequences and predicts whether they will answer the "
"next question correctly. UniKT trains and evaluates knowledge tracing "
"models under a unified data pipeline, student-level cross-validation "
"splits, and standardized metric definitions, enabling fair comparison and"
" complete reproducibility across different models."

